Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses, listed below. The per-file
list (author, source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

- Lucide icons (assets/icons/*.svg) — ISC License. See assets/icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt. The Android
  app turns them into Compose path data at build time.
- Inter typeface (assets/fonts/Inter-*.ttf) — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt.
- Noto Serif typeface (assets/fonts/NotoSerif-Regular.ttf) — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-NotoSerif.txt.
- JetBrains Mono typeface (assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf) — SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt.
- Fonts from craft-fonts (https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts), an optional build input
  (CRAFT_FONTS_DIR) that is not part of this repository. Builds made with it embed the fonts listed in
  https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts/blob/main/ATTRIBUTION.md under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- candle (speech recognition and voices on the phone, via crates.io) — MIT OR Apache-2.0, Hugging Face.

Downloaded at runtime, never in this repository or the app:

- Whisper speech-recognition models (for captions), by OpenAI — MIT. Downloaded from
  huggingface.co/openai only when the user asks, pinned to a revision and checked against its SHA-256.
- Kokoro-82M natural voices, by hexgrad — Apache-2.0, with a CMUdict-format pronunciation dictionary
  (BSD-style, Carnegie Mellon University). Downloaded only when the user asks.

Android app (apps/filmcraft-android):
- UniFFI (https://github.com/mozilla/uniffi-rs) — MPL-2.0: the uniffi crate in the library, and the
  generator of the Kotlin bindings (generated at build time, not committed).
- ndk (https://github.com/rust-mobile/ndk) — MIT OR Apache-2.0: MediaCodec for hardware video decoding.
- JNA (https://github.com/java-native-access/jna) — Apache-2.0 (dual-licensed with LGPL-2.1; used
  under Apache-2.0).
- AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, ExifInterface, Media3 (Transformer, for proxies) and kotlinx.coroutines — Apache-2.0.
